  "description": "Test build of Shaco as in League (needs League of Legends Heroes): replaces the main pack's Shaco. Backstab: his attacks and shivs deal the backstab bonus when he hits an enemy champion from behind, judged from where the target walks or faces (the main pack's backstab needs a crowd-controlled target, since data cannot read facing). Hallucinate (0.2.0): the clone is a unit of its own through the mod API's spawn_unit - it walks, attacks (10 + 40% of his attack a hit), takes 50% more damage, can be killed, and bursts where it ends (the main pack's clone and damage ride on the target); a host that gives no unit plays the main pack's clone. Jack in the Box (0.3.0): the box has a body of its own through spawn_unit - targetable, it can be destroyed (25% of his health), hidden until it springs; the add-on fires its volleys (10 + 12% of his ability power at every enemy near it, 10 times) from the body, a broken box stops; the fears stay the main pack's; a host that gives no unit keeps the main pack's box. Needs the main pack's sheet league/champions/league_shaco_jack. Other champions are untouched. Writes a log for testing.",
  "last_updated": "2026-11-14",
  "mod_id": "league_shaco_backstab",
  "mod_type": "native",
  "name": "League Heroes: Shaco's Backstab from behind, his clone and Jack in the Box as units (test)",
  "version": "0.3.0"
}
